<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51819" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθιερ-όω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατῑρόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dedicate, devote</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				164
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ μὲν γὰρ Ἀθηναίᾳ καθιέρωσεν εἰς
					ἀναθήματα . . πεντακισχιλίους στατῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					19.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λαχὸν μέρος ἑκάστῳ τῷ θεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					745d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.109
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτοὺς ὑπὲρ τῆς πατρίδος τῷ
				δαίμονι κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θέατρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					39.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				791
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				5
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>), etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμοὶ τραφείς τε καὶ
				καθιερωμένος</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				304
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Κιρραία Χώρα καθιερώθη</span>
			<i>was consecrated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.149
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθιερωμένα ἀναθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					7.14.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.22.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ καθιερούμενοι τῷ
			Διΐ</span> his priests, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.224
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>set up, establish as sacred</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φήμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					838d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμιμον καθιερωθέν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				839c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκαια ἐν στήλῃ καθιερωμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.36.9
				</span></i>
			.--Prose word, used once by <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i></div>
